        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. The subject-line contract",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Two-part structure: [Topic]: [Purpose]. The colon does the work.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#1-the-subject-line-contract",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Q3 forecast: need your number by Thu noon\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#1-the-subject-line-contract",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Onboarding doc: review request (10 min)\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#1-the-subject-line-contract",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Prefixes: Action:, Decision needed:, FYI:, Question:, Reminder:, Intro:. Avoid Following up, Quick question.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#1-the-subject-line-contract",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Length: 2-7 words wins.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#1-the-subject-line-contract",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. BLUF: Bottom Line Up Front",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The first sentence states the conclusion, the ask, or the decision needed.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#2-bluf-bottom-line-up-front",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. One ask per email",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "If the email has two asks, it has zero asks. Split into two emails, each with its own subject line.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#3-one-ask-per-email",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Test: can you summarize the ask in one sentence starting with a verb? \"Please review X by Friday.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#3-one-ask-per-email",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. To / Cc / Bcc: a deliberate decision",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "To: people who must act or reply.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#4-to-cc-bcc-a-deliberate-decision",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Cc: people who need to be informed but don't owe a reply. Use sparingly.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#4-to-cc-bcc-a-deliberate-decision",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Reply-all: default to No. Only when the answer materially changes what other recipients should do.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#4-to-cc-bcc-a-deliberate-decision",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. The \"would this fit in Slack\" test",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Anything you want a searchable, durable record of.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#5-the-would-this-fit-in-slack-test",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Long-form content (>3 paragraphs).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#5-the-would-this-fit-in-slack-test",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone whose Slack hours don't overlap yours.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#5-the-would-this-fit-in-slack-test",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. The \"phone vs email\" judgment",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Pick up the phone when:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#6-the-phone-vs-email-judgment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The topic is emotional, sensitive, or carries firing/conflict/HR risk.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#6-the-phone-vs-email-judgment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "You're on email round 3+ on the same thread without resolution.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#6-the-phone-vs-email-judgment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Tone-sensitive feedback, layoffs, performance, breakups.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#6-the-phone-vs-email-judgment",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. Follow-up cadence",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Day 0: original email",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#7-follow-up-cadence",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Day 3-4: polite nudge, reply on the same thread",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#7-follow-up-cadence",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Day 7-10: third nudge, change channel",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#7-follow-up-cadence",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Beyond: stop. The non-answer is the answer.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#7-follow-up-cadence",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "9. Send-time decisions",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Internal, ongoing relationship → send when drafted.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#9-send-time-decisions",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "External, senior, or first contact → schedule Tue-Thu 10am recipient-local.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#9-send-time-decisions",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Drafted after 9pm → always schedule for 9am next workday.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#9-send-time-decisions",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "10. Signature hygiene",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A good signature is 4 lines or fewer:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#10-signature-hygiene",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Five Cs of email — pre-send quality check",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Clear. Can the reader understand the message on a single read?",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Concise. Is every sentence earning its place?",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Complete. Does the email contain everything the reader needs to act?",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Correct. Spelling, grammar, names, titles, numbers, dates, attachments.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Courteous. Is the tone proportionate to the relationship and the stakes?",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The five things to never write:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Per my last email...\" / \"As I mentioned...\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is a known issue.\" (without immediately following it with a workaround)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#the-five-cs-of-email-pre-send-quality-check",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The wall of text - five paragraphs, no whitespace, no BLUF.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The hidden ask - buried in paragraph 4.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Reply-all \"thanks!\" - multiplies inbox noise by N for zero value.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The midnight send - signals burnout culture. Schedule for next morning.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Bcc'ing the boss as surveillance - corrosive, almost always discovered.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/email-craft/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
